---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — Image to Base64 | ImageToBase64.dpdns.org"
	description="Read our Privacy Policy. ImageToBase64.dpdns.org is 100% client-side: your files are never uploaded to any server, stored, or shared."
	canonical="https://www.imagetobase64.dpdns.org/privacy"
>
	<main style="max-width:800px; margin:0 auto; padding:64px 24px 96px; font-family:'Geist',Arial,sans-serif; color:var(--text-body); line-height:1.75;">
		<h1 style="font-size:36px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); letter-spacing:-1px; margin:0 0 8px;">
			Privacy Policy
		</h1>
		<p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-mute); margin:0 0 32px;">
			Last Updated: September 17, 2026
		</p>

		<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-color); margin-bottom:40px;"></div>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">1. Client-Side Processing Guarantee</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				At <strong>ImageToBase64.dpdns.org</strong>, we prioritize your data privacy above all else. Our tool runs 100% client-side inside your web browser. When you select, drag-and-drop, or paste an image or base64 string, all calculations, encoding, and rendering take place locally in your device's RAM using the browser HTML5 FileReader API. <strong>Your images and files are NEVER uploaded to any remote server or third-party service.</strong>
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">2. Personal Data Collection</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				We do not require user accounts, email addresses, names, or any personally identifiable information (PII) to use our service. You can freely convert unlimited images completely anonymously.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">3. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				We use minimal, privacy-focused standard web analytics (or non-tracking functional session cookies) solely to measure aggregated website traffic (such as pageview counts and country distribution). We do not track individual users across the web nor build user profiles.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">4. GDPR & CCPA Compliance</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				Because we do not store, process, or transmit personal data or uploaded images on any central database or server, our service is naturally compliant with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA).
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				Our website may contain links to external web tools or documentation. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party websites.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text-ink); margin:0 0 12px;">6. Contact Information</h2>
			<p style="margin:0;">
				If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--accent-blue); text-decoration:none;">Contact Page</a>.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
